      "side": 1,
      "message": "In the prior review I had set the default to current for MaxSdkVersion mainly because I copied the behavior for MinSdkVersion. I believe Colin pointed out that it makes more sense for MaxSdkVersion to default to infinite instead of current. The default is only used if no max_sdkvVersion is declared in Android.bp. Is there a sdk int value that represents infinity or should I set that value a lot higher?",
